# The original scene shipped without its .mtl, only the four Arnold shader
# names the faces are grouped under. These map each to the texture that
# came with it. Ks is left at zero: mud and dry thatch have no highlight,
# and a specular sheen on a hundred thousand grass tubes only reads as noise.

newmtl aiStandardSurface1SG
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
Ks 0.000 0.000 0.000
d 1.0
illum 1
map_Kd mud.jpg

newmtl aiStandardSurface2SG
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
Ks 0.000 0.000 0.000
d 1.0
illum 1
map_Kd grass.jpg

newmtl aiStandardSurface3SG
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
Ks 0.000 0.000 0.000
d 1.0
illum 1
map_Kd tree.jpg
